  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help 200 students stay in school</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide knowledge and skills development activities for 200 children from underprivileged families in Bulgaria. Through free summer activities in different locations, we will work to prevent children from dropping out of school and will help them fill the gaps in their knowledge.  Your support will contribute to the organisation of Summer START academies in different locations and will cover costs related to the execution of the Academies such as food, training materials,etc.</narrative>
  </description>
